{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 16950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15950, "text": "It's a bird."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 22170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 19350, "text": "Why do you say every animal I make looks\nlike a dog?"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 25410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 24410, "text": "Oh,"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 29630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28630, "text": "no reason."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 31569, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30670, "text": "Hi, guys."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 32570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31570, "text": "Hey. Hi, Christine."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 36010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32790, "text": "Miss Dalvin, can I ask you a question?\nSure. Oh, what a cute little dog."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 39190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38190, "text": "Never mind."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 40630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39630, "text": "Join us, Christine."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 42250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40770, "text": "Oh, I can't. I don't have the time."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 45330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42570, "text": "I just got a call from the new head of\nlegal aid, and he wants to see me."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 47590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45850, "text": "And you're going to do a little sucking\nup."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 49470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48470, "text": "Yes,"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 51470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50470, "text": "a little."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 52889, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51990, "text": "Well, good luck."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 53849, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52890, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 54850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53850, "text": "Au revoir."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 59930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58450, "text": "Bonsoir, bonsoir, bonsoir, mes amis."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 62410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60470, "text": "It is a wonderful evening. That's a par."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 64170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63170, "text": "Hey, Dan, look."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 66330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64750, "text": "Would you look at that, a beagle with\nwings."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 75470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70090, "text": "you to meet Miss Roberta LaPage. Hi. She\nworks down at Mimeo. She copies them by"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 77770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75470, "text": "the thousands, but she's one of a kind\nto me."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 83170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 78950, "text": "She has graciously accepted my\ninvitation for an evening of dining and"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 85250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 83170, "text": "and whatever the fates may bring."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 88270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86150, "text": "The battery's not included."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 92490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90490, "text": "Dan is such a great guy."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 94230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93030, "text": "Is that a fact?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 98240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 94750, "text": "Yeah. You know, it's not every... man\nwho wants to go out with a woman once"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 99760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 98240, "text": "she's taken an oath of celibacy."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 109420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 108420, "text": "An oath of what?"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 113240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110940, "text": "Celibacy. I'm abstaining from sex."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 119200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 117720, "text": "Now that was a bird."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 171210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 169550, "text": "Sounds like they're all having fun,\ndoesn't it?"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 173970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 171910, "text": "Sounds like they all had the chili for\nlunch."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 177870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 176750, "text": "You ready to start?"}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 180510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178190, "text": "Yes, sir. As soon as Christine gets back\nfrom lunch."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 181730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 180730, "text": "I'm here."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 183370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 182370, "text": "Hold that."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 185350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 184350, "text": "Let's go."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 188270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185650, "text": "First case, sir. People versus Trixie\nDubois."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 190310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188530, "text": "She's charged with prostitution."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 192070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191010, "text": "Mr. Prosecutor."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 196220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 192280, "text": "Yes, sir. Familiar story. Boy meets\ngirl. Girl asks for a C -note. Boy"}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 198540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 196220, "text": "badge. Girl offers discount. Boy busts\ngirl."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 202260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201260, "text": "Ain't love grand."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 206380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 203780, "text": "Defense? My client pleads guilty, Your\nHonor."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 210740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206640, "text": "Nothing to add? Nothing. Okay, then\nwe'll just make this $50. Not a damn"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 215060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 214060, "text": "Fine."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 218160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 215200, "text": "Then I'll just call this... Well,\nthere's really nothing left to say, is"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 221060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 220060, "text": "Let's find out."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 225920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 222440, "text": "It's all pretty cut and dried, isn't it?\nI mean, obviously a crime has been"}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 229300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225920, "text": "committed here, not one of larceny or\nviolence, mind you, but the simple"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 230300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229300, "text": "of sex."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 232520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 231200, "text": "Let's go get them chairs."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 238460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234940, "text": "And who stands before us to be punished\nfor this crime?"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 239779, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238780, "text": "The man?"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 242200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239780, "text": "The real instigator of the problem?"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 243640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 242640, "text": "No!"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 246140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244320, "text": "Right! The woman."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 249240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 246440, "text": "The eternal victim of man's history."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 250620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249620, "text": "You..."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 253770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251630, "text": "like a dick from an Eskimo pie."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 257310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256310, "text": "What's your point?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 333330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 332330, "text": "like him."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 335010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333490, "text": "Who the hell are we talking about?"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 337510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335990, "text": "Arthur Thursby, my new boss."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 341910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 338110, "text": "He... No, I don't even want to talk\nabout it. It's too heinous."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 344590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343110, "text": "I can take it. What did he do?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 362390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361390, "text": "How do you know that?"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 364150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362830, "text": "I want to show you something."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 369630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 367450, "text": "This is my college graduation picture."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 374230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370730, "text": "Gee, who would have thought you could\nput 700 faces on a wallet size?"}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 378750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375850, "text": "That's Clarence Wentworth. He was class\nvaledictorian."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 381150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379050, "text": "Miss Sullivan, I can't even make out\nrows."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 389230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387050, "text": "That's me, 364th from the left."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 392820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389570, "text": "Oh, yeah. Yeah, hey, you were our cute\nlittle dot, weren't you?"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 397740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394160, "text": "I was salutatorian, the runner -up.\nWell, that must have been quite an"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 399240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 397960, "text": "It sucks, dammit."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 402120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400920, "text": "I'll just clam up."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 407040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403220, "text": "I was supposed to be valedictorian. I\nhad the highest grade average in my"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 411320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407040, "text": "until the final semester when a certain\nprofessor decided that he liked me."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 416560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 411900, "text": "So he asked me out on a date. I politely\nturned him down. He politely gave me a"}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 417560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416560, "text": "C."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 425610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423050, "text": "Clarence Wentworth became valedictorian."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 428250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426210, "text": "He got a scholarship to Harvard Law\nSchool."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 430810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428650, "text": "I got a dinner for six at Benihana's."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 440430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 436710, "text": "It's all because I said no thank you to\na man who had authority over me."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 443970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442970, "text": "I understand."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 446130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444890, "text": "No, you don't."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 449510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448310, "text": "I guess I don't."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 451930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450930, "text": "But I'm sorry."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 454550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 453550, "text": "So am I."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 457030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456030, "text": "Miss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 461570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458070, "text": "Now, I'm going to ask you a question,\nand I want you to think about this. Do"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 468510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461570, "text": "think it could be even remotely possible\nthat that past incident is coloring"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 469690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468510, "text": "the present? Nope."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 474290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472430, "text": "Well, thanks for mulling it over."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 479090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475610, "text": "Oh, you should have been there. Oh, it's\nso smooth."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 482670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479470, "text": "It was all projection and innuendo."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 486520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 483240, "text": "Miss Sullivan, if you want to file a\nformal charge, I will stand behind you"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 491400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486520, "text": "100%. But every time one co -worker asks\nanother one out, we can't assume that"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 492920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491400, "text": "he's a sexual degenerate."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 496160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 493340, "text": "Harry, would you tell her I've got six\nmonths to live?"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 500120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 499120, "text": "Dan."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 502680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500700, "text": "Give me a physical. You'll see for\nyourself."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 506620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505420, "text": "You were saying, sir?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 511370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507540, "text": "Okay, there are... Exceptions to every\nrule, but some of us would like to think"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 514450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511370, "text": "that we are in control of our baser\nanimal instincts."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 516250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514770, "text": "Here's your Playmate magazine, sir."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 523090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519789, "text": "Miss Sullivan, I will have you know that\nthis magazine contains an in -depth"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 526950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523090, "text": "interview with Justice Sandra Day O\n'Connor along with many other well"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 528170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526950, "text": "and thought -provoking articles."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 536630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532330, "text": "My pet peeves are rainy days, people who\nfrown, and black lung disease."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 546180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544520, "text": "Gee, so that's Sandra Day O 'Connor."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 552180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 549480, "text": "Boy, a robe makes all the difference,\ndoesn't it?"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 557880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554460, "text": "Dad, listen to me. I didn't choose\ncelibacy on a whim."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 560800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558200, "text": "I needed to make a change in my life."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 562560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 561080, "text": "You didn't know the old me."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 566100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563020, "text": "All I ever thought about was sex."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 568860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566880, "text": "All I ever did was sex."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 572780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569500, "text": "And all I ever wanted was sex."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 581300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579340, "text": "What would you have thought of a woman\nlike that?"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 619470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617390, "text": "Animals are all Hindenburgers."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 623290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620730, "text": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that, sir."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 625730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624110, "text": "Well, you seem a bit more relaxed."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 630370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626090, "text": "Yeah, I guess I am. I decided to call\nArthur Thursby and politely turn down"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 631370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 630370, "text": "offer for a date."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 632389, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631390, "text": "And it's all settled?"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 633390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 632390, "text": "It's all settled."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 635430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 634430, "text": "He fired me."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 642950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 638390, "text": "He fired you?"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 647320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 644520, "text": "I told him I didn't think it would be\nproper for us to see each other after"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 650400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 647320, "text": "hours. He said he was sorry to hear that\nsince my job was involved."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 654280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650740, "text": "I told him that sounded like sexual\nharassment. He said, hit the road."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 657580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655900, "text": "Well, I guess the next step is obvious."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 658920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657920, "text": "Right, we kill him."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 662560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 661140, "text": "Then we rip his face off."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 665800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663980, "text": "Then we put it back on upside down."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 671040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668180, "text": "You subscribe to Drawn and Quarterly,\ndon't you?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 679990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 677550, "text": "You should go out tonight after all. Did\nI mention I have a trapeze?"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 683170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681390, "text": "The truth is I'm afraid."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 684570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683570, "text": "I have a net."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 686410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685150, "text": "Stan, let me be honest."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 693370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 686730, "text": "I know that your remarkable presence,\nyour obvious virility, would persuade me"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 698670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693370, "text": "to abandon my oath of celibacy and\nregress into the hot animal passions I"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 700230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698670, "text": "expressed so freely."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 722650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720270, "text": "Ecstasy. Then it abandons me there."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 727370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724670, "text": "I need satisfaction and I need it now."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 730270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729270, "text": "I understand."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 731990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730810, "text": "Do you want to be alone?"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 740990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739570, "text": "Yes. Yes."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 742450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741290, "text": "Yes, I understand."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 745250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744250, "text": "Come in."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 756300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753100, "text": "Excuse me, Monsignor. The good, the bad,\nand the ugly just dropped by."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 760300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758760, "text": "Well, can I get you folks anything?"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 761740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760660, "text": "Coffee? Tea?"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 764680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763680, "text": "Noose?"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 770540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 765960, "text": "Mr. Thursby, I'm Judge Harold T. Stone.\nJudge Stone, it's a pleasure to meet"}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 774800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770540, "text": "you, sir. I've heard so much of your\noutstanding humanistic work on the"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 775879, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775120, "text": "Oh, yeah?"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 777460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775880, "text": "Well, thanks."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 782280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 779160, "text": "Well, I can assume you're here to\ndiscuss the matter of..."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 786840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 782480, "text": "Miss Sullivan's dismissal. You bet we\nare. I'm very glad to hear that. I'd"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 792080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 786840, "text": "to do whatever I can to rectify the\nmatter. Oh, yeah? Well, thanks again."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 796460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793980, "text": "How am I doing? Oh, you got him on the\nropes, sir."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 798360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797360, "text": "Give me a chance."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 801140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799600, "text": "Here. What's this?"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 804240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801400, "text": "That's a copy of the letter we've\nwritten to the Judicial Review Board. It"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 805580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804240, "text": "charges you with sexual harassment."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 808280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807280, "text": "I see."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 810300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 809040, "text": "Well, then..."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 812560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 810760, "text": "Perhaps you'd better take a look at\nthis."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 814820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 812840, "text": "It's a letter I'm sending to the review\nboard."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 818720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816320, "text": "You mean she sexually harassed you, too?"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 823160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 820660, "text": "If you're not getting enough air, I can\nopen a window."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 830440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 827540, "text": "Wait a minute. Why are you sending a\nletter to the board?"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 833920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830660, "text": "Well, it tells my side of things. Even\nthe innocent sometimes need a good"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 836760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833920, "text": "defense. And just what do you need a\ndefense against, Thursby?"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 839420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837080, "text": "Wrongful accusations, hasty conclusions."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 842510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 840910, "text": "Getting my face ripped off."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 845570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 844490, "text": "Thursby, answer me this."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 851850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 847490, "text": "Did you or did you not tell Miss\nSullivan that you wanted to spend time"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 853250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851850, "text": "after work? Well, I did."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 854089, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 853450, "text": "Uh -huh."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 857310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 854090, "text": "And did you or did you not tell her that\nher job was involved?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 858710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857710, "text": "I did. Uh -huh."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 863450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859170, "text": "And did you or did you not plan to\ndemand sexual favors from her?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 865490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863670, "text": "No, I planned to offer her promotion."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 866870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865870, "text": "Ah."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 868170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 867170, "text": "Huh?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 877810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873770, "text": "Absolutely. Judge Stone, I'm new at this\njob."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 882150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 878350, "text": "Everyone in this department is just a\npiece of paper to me. Now, what kind of"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 886030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882150, "text": "manager would I be if I made an\nimportant and pressing decision like"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 887290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886030, "text": "on the basis of a resume?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 895870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889530, "text": "I asked Miss Sullivan to meet with me\nonly to make sure she was as impressive"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 897670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 895870, "text": "person as she is on her record."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 906050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 900590, "text": "Thursday, this good guy act of yours is\nas phony as this picture of your kid."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 908270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906310, "text": "Look at that. It doesn't even look like\nhim."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 912470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 909630, "text": "Fernando is my foster child in San\nSalvador."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 921290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918110, "text": "The picture was taken after his second\noperation."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 927970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925530, "text": "Much more of this and I'll go out with\nthe guy."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 935140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 931220, "text": "Here's a copy of the promotion\nrecommendation I sent to my superiors."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 946220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940400, "text": "Look, when you mention sexual\nharassment, I may have overreacted by"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 951660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947520, "text": "But as a lawyer, I don't have to tell\nyou the kind of damage wrongful"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 952660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 951660, "text": "can do."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 955300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953600, "text": "It can destroy a man's life."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 958740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 957620, "text": "Oh, my God."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 961720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960720, "text": "Excuse me?"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 965140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962840, "text": "I have accused an innocent man."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 967820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965880, "text": "Uh, hello? Hello? I'm sorry, what was\nthat?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 971380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969240, "text": "I made a mistake."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 973440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972420, "text": "A mistake?"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 976600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974320, "text": "As in a boo -boo of some sort?"}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 979420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978320, "text": "I'm sorry."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 980920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979680, "text": "You're sorry?"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 983920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981640, "text": "Did you hear that? She's sorry."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 992010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 985620, "text": "I stood by you. I believed in you. I\ntrusted you. And here I am, looking like"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 994390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992010, "text": "complete... Yutz?"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 998250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 996270, "text": "Thanks. Oh, don't mention it."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 1002010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 999230, "text": "Look, I understand completely."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 1004550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002410, "text": "Judge Stone, you thought you were\nprotecting a friend."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 1006610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005510, "text": "I admire that."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 1010790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007150, "text": "Yeah, well, I guess I'll be slinking out\nof here now."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 1012510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1011350, "text": "It's been my pleasure."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 1014350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013350, "text": "Are you coming?"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 1017720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014800, "text": "Yeah, in a minute. I think I should\napologize to Mr. Thursby."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 1019220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1018220, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 1021380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020380, "text": "Really?"}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 1026500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021640, "text": "Well, when you're done groveling here,\nwhy don't you slither down to my office"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 1031160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026500, "text": "with whatever shred of dignity you have\nleft so I can stomp on it?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 1036060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033500, "text": "Good day, Mr. Thursby. Good day, Judge\nStone."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 1039300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038300, "text": "Mr."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 1042780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040339, "text": "Thursby, I'm sorry I thought about\nripping your face off."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 1045460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044460, "text": "Me too."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 1054000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050440, "text": "Mr. Thursby, I feel awful. Oh, no,\nthat's all right."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 1055760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054200, "text": "Oh, no, it's not all right."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 1059440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056000, "text": "If I had persisted with these\naccusations, just think what might have"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1066320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1059900, "text": "Oh, you're really a wonderful man,\nadopting this sweet young child."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1070080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068920, "text": "Actually, he's not that young."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1072300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071300, "text": "Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1077660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076300, "text": "This is Herve Villachez."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1082900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1080820, "text": "I'll admit the resemblance is striking."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1086180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083360, "text": "And that's Ricardo Montalban in the\nbackground."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1091260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087780, "text": "I never thought anybody would look at it\nthrough a magnifying glass."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1093460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091860, "text": "Then you lie to me!"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1098140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096700, "text": "I do that sometimes."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1101820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099960, "text": "Don't you come one step closer."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1103220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102220, "text": "Or what?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1107680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104400, "text": "After crying wolf a few minutes ago,\nyour credibility is shot."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1109680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108680, "text": "Isn't it?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1110980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1109980, "text": "Christine?"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1115820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112260, "text": "The minute I laid eyes on you, I knew\nI'd have you."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1120520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1119520, "text": "Admit it."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1121880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120880, "text": "Christine."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1124160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122600, "text": "You're glad I did that."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1128160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125280, "text": "As a matter of fact, Mr. Thursby, I am."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1129800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1128800, "text": "That's thick."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1131640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130640, "text": "I like it."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1135560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134060, "text": "Are you all right? I'm fine."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1138860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135800, "text": "Did he grab you? Oh, it was just like\none of the nightmares I've had about"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1145180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144060, "text": "Down, boy. Down."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1146420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145420, "text": "Heel."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1148900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147900, "text": "Go wait outside."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1151300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1149540, "text": "I promise we'll save you the face."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1157180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1155800, "text": "Miss Sullivan, you got the evidence?"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1158560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157400, "text": "Oh, I got plenty, sir."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1162280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1158900, "text": "What do you mean, evidence? You have no\nevidence of anything. It's my word"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1163099, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162280, "text": "against hers."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1164570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1163100, "text": "Oh, well. That would be true, Mr."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1166010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164770, "text": "Thursby, if it weren't for Dr."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1169570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166350, "text": "Congo's pendicurical, self -fabricating\ncomedy, Hand Talk."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1170910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1169910, "text": "They're insane!"}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1174470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171670, "text": "They called me mad at the university."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1177470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1176470, "text": "You don't know Dr."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1180710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177530, "text": "Congo's Thursby? It's a great gag,\nreally. You pick it up in any novelty"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1184510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1180890, "text": "It's a powder. You put it on some thing,\nlike an envelope."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1186890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184930, "text": "And then you hand that envelope to\nsomeone."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1190150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187230, "text": "Now, when their sweat gets on it, things\nstart working."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1195420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190600, "text": "About five minutes later, anything\nthey've touched is going to turn bright"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1199040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1197060, "text": "Kind of like your face just now."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1204460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202260, "text": "Getting a little sweaty, are we, Mr.\nThursby?"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1208040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205600, "text": "Let's wait this one out for a couple of\nminutes."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1209420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208300, "text": "Just for laughs."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1211080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1210080, "text": "What do you say?"}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1216780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1215780, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1218400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1217400, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1220590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219590, "text": "What do you want?"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1222710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220770, "text": "I am going to file formal charges."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1228350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223090, "text": "And we are going to get you out of this\njob, out of this office, and out of this"}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1230730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228350, "text": "profession. You can count on it. Okay."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1234710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1232110, "text": "No female talks to me like that."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1240310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236410, "text": "I'll go where I want to go when I'm\ndamned good and ready."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1252830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251830, "text": "I'm ready now."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1257690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1256690, "text": "Hey!"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1263410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1259950, "text": "That was a pretty nifty little scheme of\nyours, Miss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1265610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1263650, "text": "Oh, well, I couldn't have done it\nwithout your help, sir."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1267190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265850, "text": "No, I know what all the Dr."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1268309, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267430, "text": "Khan goes."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1272450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268310, "text": "Guess you could say we caught him red\n-handed in the end, huh?"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1276490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274490, "text": "I don't see a handprint. What?"}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1278290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276910, "text": "I don't see a handprint."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1279770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278770, "text": "Are you sure?"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1281760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279960, "text": "Oh, look all you want, but there's no\nhandprint."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1283880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282880, "text": "Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1289380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284880, "text": "He's right. There's nothing there. I\nmean, there's something there, but"}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1290380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289380, "text": "no handprint."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1292120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1290600, "text": "Well, what happened?"}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1297060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1294580, "text": "Well, this isn't the envelope I put the\npowder on."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1298239, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297460, "text": "It's not?"}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1301460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298240, "text": "No. Roz must have given that envelope to\nsomeone else."}
